## Cygwin

Cygwin itself is a terminal, but you can use the [Cygwin](https://www.cygwin.com/) shell in {% data variables.product.prodname_vscode_shortname %} with the following profile:

```json
{
  "terminal.integrated.profiles.windows": {
    "Cygwin": {
      "path": "C:\\cygwin64\\bin\\bash.exe",
      "args": ["--login"]
    }
  },
  "terminal.integrated.defaultProfile.windows": "Cygwin"
}
```

This profile should be detected automatically as an [unsafe profile](#unsafe-profile-detection) when installed at the default paths `C:\cygwin` or `C:\cygwin64`.
